 "ja470:7.3": "Ariyamaggaṁ samārūha, ", "ja470:7.4": "nekāsī labhate sukhaṁ”. ", "ja470:8.1": "“Sarañca juhati poso, ", "ja470:8.2": "bahukāya gayāya ca; ", "ja470:8.3": "Doṇe timbarutitthasmiṁ, ", "ja470:8.4": "sīghasote mahāvahe. ", "ja470:9.1": "Atra cassa hutaṁ hoti, ", "ja470:9.2": "atra cassa samīhitaṁ; ", "ja470:9.3": "Atithismiṁ yo nisinnasmiṁ, ", "ja470:9.4": "neko bhuñjati bhojanaṁ. ", "ja470:10.1": "Taṁ taṁ vadāmi kosiya, ", "ja470:10.2": "dehi dānāni bhuñja ca; ", "ja470:10.3": "Ariyamaggaṁ samārūha, ", "ja470:10.4": "nekāsī labhate sukhaṁ”. ", "ja470:11.1": "“Baḷisañhi so nigilati, ", "ja470:11.2": "dīghasuttaṁ sabandhanaṁ; ", "ja470:11.3": "Atithismiṁ yo nisinnasmiṁ, ", "ja470:11.4": "eko bhuñjati bhojanaṁ. ", "ja470:12.1": "Taṁ taṁ vadāmi kosiya, ", "ja470:12.2": "dehi dānāni bhuñja ca; ", "ja470:12.3": "Ariyamaggaṁ samārūha, ", "ja470:12.4": "nekāsī labhate sukhaṁ”. ", "ja470:13.1": "“Uḷāravaṇṇā vata brāhmaṇā ime, ", "ja470:13.2": "Ayañca vo sunakho kissa hetu; ", "ja470:13.3": "Uccāvacaṁ vaṇṇanibhaṁ vikubbati, ", "ja470:13.4": "Akkhātha no brāhmaṇā ke nu tumhe”. ", "ja470:14.1": "“Cando ca suriyo ca ubho idhāgatā, ", "ja470:14.2": "Ayaṁ pana mātali devasārathi; ", "ja470:14.3": "Sakkohamasmi tidasānamindo, ", "ja470:14.4": "Eso ca kho pañcasikhoti vuccati”. ", "ja470:15.1": "“Pāṇissarā mudiṅgā ca, ", "ja470:15.2": "murajālambarāni ca; ", "ja470:15.3": "Suttamenaṁ pabodhenti, ", "ja470:15.4": "paṭibuddho ca nandati”. ", "ja470:16.1": "“Ye kecime maccharino kadariyā, ", "ja470:16.2": "Paribhāsakā samaṇabrāhmaṇānaṁ; ", "ja470:16.3": "Idheva nikkhippa sarīradehaṁ, ", "ja470:16.4": "Kāyassa bhedā nirayaṁ vajanti”. ", "ja470:17.1": "“Ye kecime suggatimāsamānā, ", "ja470:17.2": "Dhamme ṭhitā saṁyame saṁvibhāge; ", "ja470:17.3": "Idheva nikkhippa sarīradehaṁ, ", "ja470:17.4": "Kāyassa bhedā sugatiṁ vajanti. ", "ja470:18.1": "Tvaṁ nosi ñāti purimāsu jātisu, ", "ja470:18.2": "So maccharī rosako pāpadhammo; ", "ja470:18.3": "Taveva atthāya idhāgatamhā, ", "ja470:18.4": "Mā pāpadhammo nirayaṁ gamittha”. ", "ja470:19.1": "“Addhā hi maṁ vo hitakāmā, ", "ja470:19.2": "yaṁ maṁ samanusāsatha; ", "ja470:19.3": "Sohaṁ tathā karissāmi, ", "ja470:19.4": "sabbaṁ vuttaṁ hitesibhi. ", "ja470:20.1": "Esāhamajjeva upāramāmi, ", "ja470:20.2": "Na cāpihaṁ kiñci kareyya pāpaṁ; ", "ja470:20.3": "Na cāpi me kiñci adeyyamatthi, ", "ja470:20.4": "Na cāpidatvā udakaṁ pivāmi. ", "ja470:21.1": "Evañca me dadato sabbakālaṁ, ", "ja470:21.2": "Bhogā ime vāsava khīyissanti; ", "ja470:21.3": "Tato ahaṁ pabbajissāmi sakka, ", "ja470:21.4": "Hitvāna kāmāni yathodhikānī”ti. ", "ja470:22.1": "Kosiyajātakaṁ sattamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja470:0.1": "", "ja470:0.2": "", "ja470:0.3": "", "ja470:0.4": "", "ja470:1.1": "", "ja470:1.2": "ca atthi → idhatthi (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja470:1.3": "", "ja470:1.4": "", "ja470:2.1": "", "ja470:2.2": "", "ja470:2.3": "", "ja470:2.4": "nupapajjati → nūpapajjati (sya1ed, sya2ed); na upapajjati (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja470:3.1": "", "ja470:3.2": "", "ja470:3.3": "Ariyamaggaṁ samārūha → ariyaṁ maggaṁ samāruha (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja470:3.4": "", "ja470:4.1": "", "ja470:4.2": "", "ja470:4.3": "", "ja470:4.4": "", "ja470:5.1": "", "ja470:5.2": "", "ja470:5.3": "", "ja470:5.4": "", "ja470:6.1": "", "ja470:6.2": "", "ja470:6.3": "", "ja470:6.4": "", "ja470:7.1": "", "ja470:7.2": "", "ja470:7.3": "", "ja470:7.4": "", "ja470:8.1": "", "ja470:8.2": "", "ja470:8.3": "", "ja470:8.4": "", "ja470:9.1": "", "ja470:9.2": "", "ja470:9.3": "", "ja470:9.4": "", "ja470:10.1": "", "ja470:10.2": "", "ja470:10.3": "", "ja470:10.4": "", "ja470:11.1": "nigilati → niggilati (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja470:11.2": "", "ja470:11.3": "", "ja470:11.4": "", "ja470:12.1": "", "ja470:12.2": "", "ja470:12.3": "", "ja470:12.4": "", "ja470:13.1": "", "ja470:13.2": "", "ja470:13.3": "", "ja470:13.4": "", "ja470:14.1": "Cando ca suriyo ca → sūriyo ca (mr) ", "ja470:14.2": "", "ja470:14.3": "", "ja470:14.4": "", "ja470:15.1": "Pāṇissarā mudiṅgā ca → mutiṅgā ca (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja470:15.2": "", "ja470:15.3": "", "ja470:15.4": "", "ja470:16.1": "", "ja470:16.2": "", "ja470:16.3": "", "ja470:16.4": "", "ja470:17.1": "suggatimāsamānā → suggatimāsasānā (bj, pts-vp-pli1); suggatāsisamānā (mr) ", "ja470:17.2": "", "ja470:17.3": "", "ja470:17.4": "", "ja470:18.1": "", "ja470:18.2": "rosako → kosiyo (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja470:18.3": "", "ja470:18.4": "gamittha → apattha (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja470:19.1": "", "ja470:19.2": "", "ja470:19.3": "", "ja470:19.4": "", "ja470:20.1": "", "ja470:20.2": "Na cāpihaṁ → nacāpahaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja470:20.3": "", "ja470:20.4": "udakaṁ pivāmi → udakampahaṁ pibe (bj) ", "ja470:21.1": "sabbakālaṁ → … kāle (mr) ", "ja470:21.2": "", "ja470:21.3": "", "ja470:21.4": "", "ja470:22.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja470:0.1": "", "ja470:0.2": "", "ja470:0.3": "", "ja470:0.4": "", "ja470:1.1": "dr27.331, ms22J_2317, msdiv73, pts-vp-pli4.186, sya27.333, vri68.194", "ja470:1.2": "", "ja470:1.3": "", "ja470:1.4": "", "ja470:2.1": "ms22J_2318, msdiv74", "ja470:2.2": "", "ja470:2.3": "", "ja470:2.4": "", "ja470:3.1": "ms22J_2319, msdiv75", "ja470:3.2": "", "ja470:3.3": "", "ja470:3.4": "", "ja470:4.1": "bj30.428, ms22J_2320, msdiv76, ndp22.242", "ja470:4.2": "", "ja470:4.3": "", "ja470:4.4": "", "ja470:5.1": "ms22J_2321, msdiv77", "ja470:5.2": "", "ja470:5.3": "", "ja470:5.4": "", "ja470:6.1": "csp1ed22.250, csp2ed22.250, ms22J_2322, msdiv78", "ja470:6.2": "", "ja470:6.3": "", "ja470:6.4": "", "ja470:7.1": "ms22J_2323, msdiv79", "ja470:7.2": "", "ja470:7.3": "", "ja470:7.4": "", "ja470:8.1": "ms22J_2324, msdiv80", "ja470:8.2": "", "ja470:8.3": "", "ja470:8.4": "", "ja470:9.1": "dr27.332, ms22J_2325, msdiv81", "ja470:9.2": "", "ja470:9.3": "", "ja470:9.4": "", "ja470:10.1": "ms22J_2326, msdiv82, sya27.334", "ja470:10.2": "", "ja470:10.3": "", "ja470:10.4": "", "ja470:11.1": "ms22J_2327, msdiv83", "ja470:11.2": "", "ja470:11.3": "", "ja470:11.4": "", "ja470:12.1": "ms22J_2328, msdiv84", "ja470:1